;   Per-frame hook for the inspect mark.
;
;   x5.pds, after the unused-sprite wipe:
;
;       jsr tickmana
;       jmp emptypan
;
;   That `jsr tickmana` is at $DFF0 (tickmana = $F2C5, emptypan = $F199).
;   The two bytes here are the address of `inspdraw`, which calls tickmana
;   and then, once a cast has set the latch, the marker. The `jmp emptypan`
;   that follows is not written.
;
;   Written by us. Eurocom's source is read-only and pinned; see README.md.

        org $dff1
insphook dw inspdraw
